      "id": "domain_concept:choice-question",
      "kind": "domain_concept",
      "statement": "A ChoiceQuestion names the bounded decision purpose, typed target domain, beneficiary or end, horizon and decision authority to be settled; it is a documentary refinement of InquiryQuestion and AssessmentFrame, not a universal selector.",
